# LiNKtrend git branching (managed)

- Integration branch: **`development`**
- Work branch: **`issue/<PREFIX>-<n>-<slug>`** (one short-lived branch per Ledger work ID, given by the orchestrator)
- Cloud agents may use `cursor/*`; `dev/*` is rare ad-hoc only
- Only the orchestrator opens and merges pull requests into `development` (Full CI plus one exact-head independent review)
- Only two long-lived branches: `development` and `main`. Promotion `development` → temporary `promote/main/*` → `main` is orchestrator-only

## Session entrypoints

- **New coding session:** `/agentsetup` → `.cursor/commands/agentsetup.md` → `.cursor/skills/agentsetup/SKILL.md`
- **Already-open / wrong branch:** `/agentcomply` → `.cursor/commands/agentcomply.md` → `.cursor/skills/agentcomply/SKILL.md`
- Auto issue/branch: `python3 scripts/gitops/create_issue_branch.py` (never ask humans for issue id/slug)

## Hard stops

- No worker pull requests, no self-merge, no self-review, no `main` promotion from worker sessions
- Workers commit and push often; the orchestrator packages
